      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/ac8455/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2016-01-28T16:06:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Reverend Pete\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Reverend Pete:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Also, it may be that the unlocker played 3 fleets of foot on that last blow. The Third could be hidden behind that variant card. I’ll try to do that next.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>There’s definitely something below the variant card. It has to be something that let Tachy play another card as part of its effects (or else the first 2 fleet of foots would be in the trash). Either a third fleet of foot or lightning reflexes.</p>",
